# Level 3 needs "three other nonland permanents" to sacrifice: Bot1 reaches it with Swamps only (lands are not
# sacrificed to it), so at the beginning of its end step in turn 5 the "you may" is never asked (`! Bot1.Accept`) and
# nothing is sacrificed. The sibling scenario, with Moxen to sacrifice, is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Scavenger's Talent
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Scavenger's Talent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Scavenger's Talent.Activate(Ability: Level 2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Scavenger's Talent.Activate(Ability: Level 3)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.End]
! Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Scavenger's Talent
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
